1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,331
(Penny:)Well, do you know anybody?

2
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:05,921
(Leonard:)Well, I'm sure the guy living with Sheldon
wouldn't mind moving in with you.

3
00:00:07,965 --> 00:00:11,055
(Penny:)Oh, Leonard, honey,
if we started living together...

4
00:00:11,219 --> 00:00:14,219
(Penny:)...I wouldn't be able
to keep my hands off you.

5
00:00:16,557 --> 00:00:17,977
(Penny:)Really?

6
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,560
(Penny:)And you thought my acting lessons
were a waste of money.

7
00:00:27,735 --> 00:00:31,735
Ugh. This moo shu pork's burning a hole
through my duodenum.

8
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:35,532
Tsk, tsk. Leviticus 11:3.

9
00:00:35,701 --> 00:00:40,701
That which parteth the hoof and cheweth
the cud among the beasts shall ye eat.

10
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:47,380
Hey, do I mock you with the Bhagavad Gita
every time you scarf down a Whopper?

11
00:00:52,134 --> 00:00:56,014
- Hey, what's going on?
- We're on a quest to the Valley of Fire.

12
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)You want the Valley of Fire?
It's right here.

